:-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1011","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[39,27,70,78,65,64],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[39,27,70,78,65,64],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1003","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[39,27,70,78,65,64],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10005","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[39,27,70,78,65,64],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国官臣，西晋开国大臣。出身陈郡何氏，为曹魏太仆何夔之子，东汉车骑将军何熙的玄孙。少袭父爵，好学博闻，事亲至孝，早年于魏仕官。高平陵之变后，依附司马氏，参与废立之谋，深得司马懿、司马师、司马昭信任。司马昭欲立次子司马攸为继位者时何曾劝其不应废长立幼，晋国成立后官至丞相。其人明于礼法，善识时势，朝堂议事，多持稳妥之论，保全自身与家族；奢汰无度，厨膳滋味，过于王者。每宴见，不食官厨之食，自备珍馐。一日食费至万钱，犹云无下箸处。外宽内忌，好察人短，当面温雅，背后毁伤。虽身居高位，识见局限，预见其子何绥必因奢败，却不能约束家门。身后未久，何氏子弟果遭倾覆。","tc":"魏國官臣，西晉開國大臣。出身陳郡何氏，為曹魏太仆何夔之子，東漢車騎將軍何熙的玄孫。少襲父爵，好學博聞，事親至孝，早年于魏仕官。高平陵之變后，依附司馬氏，參與廢立之謀，深得司馬懿、司馬師、司馬昭信任。司馬昭欲立次子司馬攸為繼位者時何曾勸其不應廢長立幼，晉國成立后官至丞相。其人明于禮法，善識時勢，朝堂議事，多持穩妥之論，保全自身與家族；奢汰無度，廚膳滋味，過于王者。每宴見，不食官廚之食，自備珍饈。一日食費至萬錢，猶云無下箸處。外寬內忌，好察人短，當面溫雅，背后毀傷。雖身居高位，識見局限，預見其子何綏必因奢敗，卻不能約束家門。身后未久，何氏子弟果遭傾覆。","en":"An official of Wei and a founding minister of the Western Jin dynasty. When Sima Zhao wished to name his second son Sima You as heir, He Zeng advised against setting aside the elder son in favor of the younger. After the establishment of the Jin dynasty, he rose to the rank of Prime Minister.","jp":"魏の臣で、西晋の開国功臣。司馬昭が次男の司馬攸を後継者に立てようとした際、何曾は長を廃して幼を立てるべきではないと諫めた。晋の成立後は官位は丞相にまで至った。","kr":"위나라의 신하이자 서진의 개국대신. 사마소가 차남 사마유를 후계자로 세우려 하자 장자를 폐하고 유자를 세워서는 안 된다고 간언하였으며, 진나라가 건국된 후에는 관직이 승상에 이르렀다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10786","remark":"","surname":"何","surnameTc":"何","surnameEn":"He","surnameJp":"何","surnameKr":"하","surnameOther":"","name":"曾","nameTc":"曾","nameEn":"Zeng","nameJp":"曽","nameKr":"증","nameOther":"","word":"颖考","wordTc":"穎考","wordEn":"Yingkao","wordJp":"穎考","wordKr":"영고","wordOther":"","icon":"何曾","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"216","city":"CS1003","gender":"0","rule":"39","force":"27","wise":"70","politics":"78","charm":"65","will":"64","ruleTalent":"3","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"9/9/9/9/9/71/36/9","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1500","battleSoulPoint":"700","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/1/3/0/0/0/2/0/2/0/1/2/1/0/4/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"22","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"199","show":"216","deat